### Lấy danh sách staffs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/staffs
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Lấy chi tiết staff theo id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/staffs/{{staffId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Tạo staff mới
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/staffs
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"name": "Nguyen Van Staff",
	"avatar": "https://example.com/avatar.png",
	"email": "staff01@example.com",
	"password": "Password123!",
	"isActive": true,
	"role": "staff"
}


### Tạo staff mới role admin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/staffs
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"name": "Nguyen Van Admin",
	"avatar": "https://example.com/avatar.png",
	"email": "admin@example.com",
	"password": "Password123!",
	"isActive": true,
	"role": "admin"

}

### Cập nhật staff
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/staffs/{{staffId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
	"name": "Nguyen Van Staff Updated"
}

### Xóa staff
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/staffs/{{staffId}}
